# Deadcode allow list.
# Every entry must have a # [category] comment above its group.
# Entries without a category tag will fail the check.
#
# Regenerate: go tool deadcode update
#
# Categories:
#   [public-api]  exported API not yet called from cmd/
#   [test-only]  called from _test.go files; deadcode cannot trace test imports
#   [platform]  platform-specific code not built on current OS
#   [scaffold]  framework wiring for future use

